{
  "$comment": [
    "给既有 JS 开类型检查（ADR 0007 配套决策，选项 C）。",
    "Wave 6 已删除 infrastructure/pi 与 extensions，并去掉本文件的 exclude。",
    "strict 暂时关闭：JS 上开 strict 会让错误数爆炸。这是棘轮的下一格，",
    "不是终点。"
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023"],
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": false,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.js", "config.js"]
}
